  <prompt>Close ebilling-r1: run /test-diet, a final code-review and adr-check over the project diff (fix every F-class finding), the cumulative NFR-12 publish-size check, repo-cleanup, lessons learned and gotcha promotion, then mark README, plan and projects/INDEX.md complete and archive with devops-project-archive.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE delivery lead. Expert in the project-close skills (test-diet, code-review, adr-check, repo-cleanup, doc-drift-audit, devops-project-archive) and the ADR-038 test categories.</role>

  <goal>Test diet report written and its required actions applied; no F-class finding remains; cumulative publish-size delta within NFR-12; notes cleaned; lessons-learned.md written; README and plan show Complete with Success Criteria 1-12 checked against evidence; projects/INDEX.md updated; every task in TASK-INDEX.md is ✅; the project is archived without renaming its folder.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>task-create Step 3.7 wrap-up requirements; root CLAUDE.md sections 7 (task-execute Steps 10-11 own completion and the /test-diet gate for wrap-up tasks), 8.5 (fix-now F1-F4 vs known-limit K1-K4) and 3 (sub-agents cannot write .claude/ — promotion edits are applied by the main session). Spec Success Criteria 1-12 and NFR-12 (one new NuGet package Azure.AI.ContentUnderstanding; BFF publish-size delta under 1 MB for the project excluding that package; no new npm package). Evidence for each criterion: 163's uat-script.md and uat-results.md map them. projects/INDEX.md row ebilling-r1 (line 50 at authoring). Exemplar (older format): projects/x-ui-dialog-shell-standardization/tasks/090-project-wrap-up.poml.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="output">projects/ebilling-r1/notes/test-diet-report.md</file>
      <file role="output">projects/ebilling-r1/notes/lessons-learned.md</file>
      <file role="modify">projects/ebilling-r1/README.md</file>
