  <steps mode="prescriptive">
    <step order="1">Verify every task except 190 shows ✅ in TASK-INDEX.md; list any that does not and STOP if one is open.</step>
    <step order="2">Run /test-diet for ebilling-r1; write notes/test-diet-report.md; apply its required actions; dotnet test green.</step>
    <step order="3">Run /code-review and /adr-check over the project diff (git diff master...work/ebilling-r1); classify findings per task-execute Step 9.5; fix every F-class finding and re-check the fix diff; record findings and resolutions in notes.</step>
    <step order="4">NFR-12: fresh master publish vs branch publish of Sprk.Bff.Api; record total delta and delta excluding the Content Understanding package; dotnet list package --vulnerable; confirm no new npm dependency.</step>
    <step order="5">Run /repo-cleanup projects/ebilling-r1; approve removals of notes/debug/, notes/drafts/ and obsolete spikes; archive notes/handoffs/ to .archive/; keep evaluation-set manifest, ground truth, generator and all result notes.</step>
    <step order="6">Write notes/lessons-learned.md: one lesson per entry with a one-line summary, covering corrections and confirmed non-obvious approaches; scan the project CLAUDE.md gotchas and list durable ones proposed for .claude/FAILURE-MODES.md or a pattern (main session applies them); run /doc-drift-audit for the project's changed areas and file or fix drift.</step>
    <step order="7">README.md: Status Complete, Phase Complete, Progress 100%, Last Updated and Completed Date, Graduation Criteria checked with evidence links (Success Criteria 1-12), changelog entry. plan.md: Status Complete, every milestone ✅.</step>
    <step order="8">projects/INDEX.md: update the ebilling-r1 row to complete with the completion date and a one-line outcome.</step>
    <step order="9">Run /devops-project-archive (closes the Issue, sets the board status, writes projects/ebilling-r1/.archived); do not rename the folder.</step>
    <step order="10">Update TASK-INDEX.md: this task's status cell to "✅ [done]".</step>
    <step order="11">Record deviations in projects/ebilling-r1/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If an F-class fix does not converge or would change an API contract or schema, STOP and raise 🔔 Human Input Required (root CLAUDE.md section 6).</trigger>
    <trigger>If the cumulative publish-size delta excluding the Content Understanding package is 1 MB or more, STOP: NFR-12 is breached; present the per-task contributions and options.</trigger>
    <trigger>If any Success Criterion lacks evidence or an owner decision, STOP before marking the README complete.</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <tools>
    <tool name="dotnet">build, test, publish, list package</tool>
    <tool name="git">diff (read-only)</tool>
    <tool name="gh">issue and board updates via devops-project-archive</tool>
  </tools>

