  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">notes/test-diet-report.md exists and every required action in it is applied; dotnet test passes.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">code-review and adr-check over the project diff report no open F-class finding; any K-class item is listed with its class and reason.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Cumulative publish-size delta excluding Azure.AI.ContentUnderstanding is under 1 MB against a fresh master build; no new HIGH CVE; no new npm package.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">notes/lessons-learned.md exists with one-line-summary entries; durable gotchas are listed as proposals for the main session.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">README shows Complete with Success Criteria 1-12 checked and each linked to evidence; plan.md shows Complete with every milestone ✅; projects/INDEX.md row updated.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Every task in TASK-INDEX.md is ✅; projects/ebilling-r1/.archived exists; the folder name is unchanged.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">repo-cleanup removed no evaluation-set manifest, ground truth, generator or result note.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

